# Sunpetal Grove: "This land enters tapped unless you control a Forest or a Plains." (CR 614.12, 614.1d: read on
# the battlefield as it enters, so the land itself is never one of the two). Beside a Swamp only the first copy enters
# tapped (turn 3); once a Forest is out the second enters untapped (turn 7), the positive control for the first. It also
# taps for {G} or {W}: blue is refused beside the green it does add, and the {G} activation is that positive control; the first copy then
# taps for {W} on turn 7, the other half of the choice. Bot2's Forest and Plains do not count: not "you control".

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Sunpetal Grove
Forest
Sunpetal Grove
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Plains
Island
